 the world's largest, most advanced organizations to optimize and secure every application and Application Programming Interface (\"API\") anywhere, including on-premises, in the cloud, and at the network edge. F5 enables businesses to continuously stay ahead of threats while delivering exceptional, secure digital experiences for their customers.","zh":"F5 是一家多雲應用程式交付和安全供應商，致力於為生活帶來更美好的數位世界。 F5 與世界上最大、最先進的組織合作，優化和保護任何地方的每個應用程式和應用程式介面 (“API”)，包括本地、雲端和網路邊緣。 F5 讓企業能夠持續領先於威脅，同時為客戶提供卓越、安全的數位體驗。"},{"en":"Our application delivery and security solutions are available in a range of deployment and consumption models. We sell packaged software in perpetual, subscription, and usage-based consumption models. We also sell our solutions in software-as-a-service (\"SaaS\") and managed services deployment models with subscription and usage-based consumption models. In addition, we sell high-performance systems, or hardware, as well as a broad range of global services including maintenance, consulting, training and other technical support services.","zh":"我們的應用程式交付和安全解決方案可用於多種部署和消費性模型。我們以永久、訂閱和基於使用的消費模式銷售打包軟體。我們也銷售軟體即服務（「SaaS」）解決方案和託管服務部署模型，以及基於訂閱和基於使用的消費模型。此外，我們還銷售高效能係統或硬件，以及廣泛的全球服務，包括維護、諮詢、培訓和其他技術支援服務。"},{"en":"Our customers include large enterprise businesses, public sector institutions, governments, and service providers. We conduct our business globally and manage our business by geography. Our business is organized into three primary geographic regions: Americas; Europe, the Middle East, and Africa (\"EMEA\"); and the Asia Pacific region (\"APAC\").","zh":"我們的客戶包括大型企業、公共部門機構、政府和服務提供者。我們在全球範圍內開展業務並按地理位置管理我們的業務。我們的業務分為三個主要地理區域：美洲；歐洲、中東和非洲（「EMEA」）；以及亞太地區（「APAC」）。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"As F5 expands its reach and role into a broader set of hybrid multicloud application delivery and security solutions, our competitive set evolves and includes vendors with capabilities associated with application delivery, application security, and multicloud networking.","zh":"隨著 F5 將其影響範圍和作用擴展到更廣泛的混合多雲應用程式交付和安全解決方案中，我們的競爭群體不斷發展，包括具有應用程式交付、應用程式安全和多雲網路相關功能的供應商。"},{"en":"The principal competitive factors in the markets in which we compete include deployment model, consumption model, ecosystem integrations, features and performance, customer support, brand recognition, scope of distribution and sales channels, and pricing. We believe we generally compete favorably on the basis of these factors because of our robust solutions and services, our ability to deliver and secure any application, and any API, anywhere, and our platform approach.","zh":"我們競爭的市場中的主要競爭因素包括部署模式、消費模式、生態系統整合、功能和性能、客戶支援、品牌認知度、分銷和銷售通路範圍以及定價。我們相信，由於我們強大的解決方案和服務、我們在任何地方交付和保護任何應用程式和任何 API 的能力以及我們的平台方法，我們總體上在這些因素的基礎上具有有利的競爭優勢。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Service","val":1579432000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Product","val":1508640000,"zh":"產品"}],"total":3088072000},"geo":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":1724069000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":1631180000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":827168000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":536835000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other Americas","val":92889000,"zh":"其他美洲"}],"total":3088072000}},"peers":["AKAM","NTAP","CTSH","VRSN","CHKP"]}}